cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulation or report, please cite the repository version you used and the source literature cited in the report."
title: "Event-aware Reinforcement Learning for Long-run Patch Foraging: A Simulation Report"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A synthetic two-action patch-foraging simulation comparing event-aware,
  event-blind, event-free and threshold policies using average-reward policy
  iteration. This is a proof-of-concept study, not an empirical biological result.
